WEBVTT

00:00:06.089 --> 00:00:09.426
A NETFLIX ORIGINAL ANIME SERIES

00:00:12.637 --> 00:00:15.807
ORIGINAL WORK BY KOUSUKE OONO

00:00:16.516 --> 00:00:19.811
PRODUCED BY NETFLIX

00:01:42.018 --> 00:01:43.895
EPISODE 49

00:01:43.978 --> 00:01:45.313
SPIN

00:01:45.939 --> 00:01:46.856
GRAB

00:01:48.858 --> 00:01:50.151
<i>This can't be…</i>

00:01:50.985 --> 00:01:52.821
VIRUS

00:01:52.904 --> 00:01:53.780
<i>A cold?</i>

00:01:55.198 --> 00:01:56.074
OPEN

00:01:56.157 --> 00:01:57.075
SLAM

00:01:57.158 --> 00:01:58.284
POUR

00:01:58.952 --> 00:01:59.786
Sorry, but…

00:02:00.411 --> 00:02:01.996
<i>I won't let that happen!</i>

00:02:02.580 --> 00:02:05.875
Do you know who you're messing with?

00:02:05.959 --> 00:02:07.085
BEEP

00:02:07.669 --> 00:02:09.337
What? You've gotta be kidding.

00:02:09.921 --> 00:02:12.757
Staying up late,
not dressing warm, dry air indoors…

00:02:13.466 --> 00:02:15.593
There's no one to blame but yourself.

00:02:16.553 --> 00:02:18.304
Ginger and lemon.

00:02:18.388 --> 00:02:22.142
Cool it a little,
then add that vitamin-packed honey.

00:02:22.225 --> 00:02:24.018
This'll warm up my body.

00:02:26.229 --> 00:02:28.690
Got your weapons ready, gang?

00:02:28.773 --> 00:02:29.607
-Yeah!
-Yeah!

00:02:29.691 --> 00:02:33.194
Now for the humidifier
and Miku's facial steamer!

00:02:33.278 --> 00:02:35.155
STEAM

00:02:35.238 --> 00:02:37.115
<i>This prevents dryness.</i>

00:02:37.740 --> 00:02:39.826
<i>To be doubly sure,
drink some cold medicine</i>

00:02:39.909 --> 00:02:41.327
and rest!

00:02:41.411 --> 00:02:44.581
Hey, c'mon then, do you want some?

00:02:46.124 --> 00:02:46.958
<i>What?</i>

00:02:47.542 --> 00:02:48.543
It went up?

00:02:49.836 --> 00:02:50.670
BAM

00:02:50.753 --> 00:02:51.629
I can still…

00:02:52.297 --> 00:02:53.131
COLLAPSE

00:02:53.214 --> 00:02:54.215
…still…

00:02:54.299 --> 00:02:56.134
fight back…

00:02:56.634 --> 00:02:59.053
WHITE BLOOD CELLS

00:02:59.762 --> 00:03:01.514
-Stop this!
-Huh?

00:03:02.515 --> 00:03:04.517
Fighting will not solve anything.

00:03:06.728 --> 00:03:07.896
Light…

00:03:09.522 --> 00:03:11.149
Oh, are you awake?

00:03:11.232 --> 00:03:12.525
Oh, so cold.

00:03:13.568 --> 00:03:14.569
Miku…

00:03:14.652 --> 00:03:16.487
I was worried about you.

00:03:17.071 --> 00:03:18.698
You were on the floor when I got home.

00:03:19.282 --> 00:03:21.075
This much is nothing.

00:03:21.159 --> 00:03:22.160
I'll get dinner--

00:03:22.243 --> 00:03:23.119
SMACK

00:03:25.204 --> 00:03:26.289
Just get some rest.

00:03:26.372 --> 00:03:27.582
Want something to eat?

00:03:27.665 --> 00:03:28.583
Yeah.

00:03:28.666 --> 00:03:30.126
Something to drink.

00:03:30.209 --> 00:03:35.089
I made this for you just now by
whizzing up all the veggies in the fridge.

00:03:35.173 --> 00:03:36.925
-I put supplements in too.
-What?

00:03:37.550 --> 00:03:38.384
Here.

00:03:50.563 --> 00:03:51.397
RISE

00:03:52.690 --> 00:03:53.900
I'm better.

00:03:55.360 --> 00:03:56.653
How do you feel, Tacchan?

00:03:57.237 --> 00:03:59.739
Oh, just a bit of a stomachache.

00:04:04.827 --> 00:04:06.454
EPISODE 50

00:04:06.537 --> 00:04:09.040
Happy New Year.

00:04:09.123 --> 00:04:10.583
Thanks. Happy New Year.

00:04:10.667 --> 00:04:14.170
It's New Year and I'm totally broke.

00:04:14.254 --> 00:04:15.380
Oh, right!

00:04:15.463 --> 00:04:18.216
<i>I'll go and get
my New Year's money gift from Boss!</i>

00:04:19.217 --> 00:04:22.387
<i>Boss, I'll be collecting that swag now!</i>

00:04:22.470 --> 00:04:23.638
DING DONG

00:04:23.721 --> 00:04:25.098
NEW YEARS

00:04:25.682 --> 00:04:27.183
Happy New Year.

00:04:27.684 --> 00:04:30.144
-What's that you have on?
-Oh, it's from this.

00:04:30.728 --> 00:04:32.939
Some goods I picked up on a raid.

00:04:33.022 --> 00:04:35.733
An apron lucky bag
from the New Year's sale.

00:04:35.817 --> 00:04:38.152
Things are looking cushy for you already!

00:04:38.236 --> 00:04:39.320
I'm so jealous.

00:04:39.404 --> 00:04:41.322
You can have this if you want.

00:04:41.406 --> 00:04:42.991
Nah, I'm good.

00:04:43.992 --> 00:04:46.202
Masa, Happy New Year!

00:04:46.286 --> 00:04:47.620
Thank you, ma'am!

00:04:47.704 --> 00:04:50.123
We were doing
our first calligraphy of the year.

00:04:50.206 --> 00:04:52.125
Wow, it really feels like New Years.

00:04:52.208 --> 00:04:53.376
Wanna write something?

00:04:53.459 --> 00:04:54.752
Oh, is that okay?

00:04:55.295 --> 00:04:56.337
All right.

00:04:56.421 --> 00:04:57.839
NO MONEY

00:04:58.423 --> 00:04:59.799
What the hell is that?

00:04:59.882 --> 00:05:01.676
Jeez, did I mess up?

00:05:01.759 --> 00:05:03.845
You have to write
your hopes for this year.

00:05:03.928 --> 00:05:04.887
I see.

00:05:04.971 --> 00:05:05.930
RUMBLE

00:05:06.931 --> 00:05:09.934
I'm a bit broke at the moment,
so it can't be helped, I guess…

00:05:10.018 --> 00:05:11.894
-Come with me.
-Here we go!

00:05:12.520 --> 00:05:13.604
BASH

00:05:13.688 --> 00:05:14.981
BASH

00:05:15.732 --> 00:05:18.026
Glad I borrowed this gear
from the landlord.

00:05:18.526 --> 00:05:20.820
Wow, that mochi looks delicious!

00:05:20.903 --> 00:05:22.780
I would swap it for cash though!

00:05:23.364 --> 00:05:25.241
I understand, Masa.

00:05:25.825 --> 00:05:27.744
Of course, I haven't forgotten.

00:05:27.827 --> 00:05:29.203
The brown powder.

00:05:30.788 --> 00:05:32.665
Yeah, that's what I'm talking about.

00:05:32.749 --> 00:05:33.791
SMACK

00:05:33.875 --> 00:05:34.709
SMACK

00:05:34.792 --> 00:05:36.377
Whoa, good shot, Masa!

00:05:36.461 --> 00:05:39.630
Hey Boss, you know what happens
when you lose, right?

00:05:39.714 --> 00:05:41.340
Tsk. Okay, go ahead then.

00:05:41.424 --> 00:05:42.341
WHERE'S MY MONEY?

00:05:42.425 --> 00:05:43.259
Finished yet?

00:05:45.720 --> 00:05:47.138
Run!

00:05:48.598 --> 00:05:49.432
SMACK

00:05:49.515 --> 00:05:51.601
Man, I've gone and dropped it!

00:05:51.684 --> 00:05:53.227
I dropped it 'coz I'm so weak…

00:05:53.311 --> 00:05:54.645
It's 'coz I'm so poor!

00:05:54.729 --> 00:05:56.939
Hold it properly, why don't you?

00:05:57.023 --> 00:05:59.025
It's hard when you don't have any money!

00:05:59.108 --> 00:06:01.152
You would drop it too, Boss,
if you were poor.

00:06:01.235 --> 00:06:03.988
Look at these, uh, seven or eight people.

00:06:04.072 --> 00:06:05.239
All of them are rich.

00:06:05.323 --> 00:06:07.867
Bet they would give out cash for New Year…

00:06:07.950 --> 00:06:09.494
Look, hand it over. I'll carry it.

00:06:09.577 --> 00:06:10.703
No, hold on.

00:06:10.787 --> 00:06:13.081
-What the hell? Let go.
-I don't want to.

00:06:13.164 --> 00:06:14.791
Oh, it's Tatsu.

00:06:14.874 --> 00:06:16.125
Oh, Ryota.

00:06:16.209 --> 00:06:17.585
Happy New Year, Tatsu.

00:06:17.668 --> 00:06:19.003
Happy New Year.

00:06:19.087 --> 00:06:21.047
Hey, little man,
you going kite flying too?

00:06:21.130 --> 00:06:22.465
No, we've got a drone.

00:06:22.548 --> 00:06:23.633
So high-tech!

00:06:23.716 --> 00:06:25.551
My dad and I are flying it over there.

00:06:25.635 --> 00:06:26.469
Whoa.

00:06:26.552 --> 00:06:27.762
Oh, yeah, Ryota.

00:06:27.845 --> 00:06:29.597
It's not much,
but here's your New Year's money gift.

00:06:29.680 --> 00:06:30.973
What? Hooray!

00:06:31.057 --> 00:06:32.308
Thank you so much!

00:06:33.017 --> 00:06:33.851
SINK

00:06:36.604 --> 00:06:38.439
What about me?

00:06:38.523 --> 00:06:40.608
<i>Where's my New Year's money?</i>

00:06:40.691 --> 00:06:43.444
NEW YEARS

00:06:44.237 --> 00:06:45.154
Here you are.

00:06:45.238 --> 00:06:46.572
Local Sake Fair?

00:06:46.656 --> 00:06:48.616
Didn't know they do
this sort of thing here.

00:06:48.699 --> 00:06:49.784
Looks interesting.

00:06:49.867 --> 00:06:51.828
It's at a couple of places.

00:06:52.411 --> 00:06:53.538
Here's the place.

00:06:53.621 --> 00:06:55.873
Oh look, it's all happening here!

00:06:55.957 --> 00:06:57.250
Table for three?

00:06:57.333 --> 00:06:58.209
Sure.

00:07:02.213 --> 00:07:04.632
This one is Matsu no Tsuyu.

00:07:04.715 --> 00:07:07.176
It uses spring water
found 120 meters underground.

00:07:07.260 --> 00:07:10.096
It's pure rice wine
with regionally sourced rice.

00:07:10.179 --> 00:07:14.183
Hey, this is the real deal, it hasn't got
any of that other stuff mixed in.

00:07:14.267 --> 00:07:16.436
Wow, Boss, this is something else!

00:07:20.189 --> 00:07:23.693
<i>That mellow fragrance and sharp flavor…</i>

00:07:23.776 --> 00:07:24.777
SAKE

00:07:24.861 --> 00:07:26.529
<i>…cuts through like a samurai sword!</i>

00:07:28.156 --> 00:07:29.949
Would you like to try this one as well?

00:07:30.032 --> 00:07:31.576
Oh, yes, please.

00:07:36.539 --> 00:07:38.499
Hey, ma'am,
I think you've had a bit too much…

00:07:40.251 --> 00:07:41.919
Masa, are you still drinking?

00:07:42.545 --> 00:07:44.505
-Here you go.
-Oh, thanks.

00:07:45.089 --> 00:07:45.965
SPLASH

00:07:47.508 --> 00:07:49.135
Hey, Boss, help me out…

00:07:50.553 --> 00:07:51.512
SNORE

00:07:51.596 --> 00:07:52.930
Sleeping with his eyes open?

00:07:54.974 --> 00:07:56.809
It's a snot bubble!

00:07:56.893 --> 00:07:58.394
Boss, please stay with us.

00:07:58.478 --> 00:07:59.312
STOMP

00:08:00.354 --> 00:08:01.564
The Steelfist Tiger?

00:08:03.065 --> 00:08:04.108
SOB

00:08:05.193 --> 00:08:06.027
I spilled it.

00:08:07.612 --> 00:08:11.657
-I spilled it and it's all my fault!
-No, look, it's fine.

00:08:12.366 --> 00:08:13.576
Why don't you calm down?

00:08:13.659 --> 00:08:14.494
Boss?

00:08:14.577 --> 00:08:16.996
Drink some water and clear your head!

00:08:17.079 --> 00:08:18.206
That's sake!

00:08:18.289 --> 00:08:19.707
This is bad.

00:08:19.790 --> 00:08:21.417
Boss is also drunk.

00:08:22.251 --> 00:08:24.879
<i>Ugh, I don't wanna deal with this.</i>

00:08:24.962 --> 00:08:25.838
SLIP

00:08:28.049 --> 00:08:29.509
My… chopsticks…

00:08:29.592 --> 00:08:31.052
It's fine, you can ask for new ones.

00:08:31.135 --> 00:08:32.845
My chopsticks!

00:08:32.929 --> 00:08:35.264
Excuse me,
another pair of chopsticks, please!

00:08:35.348 --> 00:08:37.266
What happened?

00:08:38.059 --> 00:08:39.227
Chopsticks!

00:08:41.062 --> 00:08:42.438
Is it that funny?

00:08:44.482 --> 00:08:46.108
Boss.

00:08:46.192 --> 00:08:47.193
Masa…

00:08:47.693 --> 00:08:49.195
I'll…

00:08:50.404 --> 00:08:52.156
leave the rest to you…

00:08:52.240 --> 00:08:53.199
SNORE

00:08:53.282 --> 00:08:54.116
Boss!

00:08:54.200 --> 00:08:56.536
Sir, ma'am? Are you okay?

00:08:59.163 --> 00:09:00.039
Excuse me,

00:09:00.122 --> 00:09:01.290
I'm gonna vomit.

00:09:01.374 --> 00:09:02.500
Toilets are over there!

00:09:02.583 --> 00:09:04.502
THE NEXT MORNING…

00:09:06.546 --> 00:09:08.422
SLURP

00:09:09.006 --> 00:09:10.675
<i>-That hits the spot…
-That hits the spot…</i>

00:09:15.763 --> 00:09:17.431
EPISODE 52

00:09:19.809 --> 00:09:22.979
Right, so today,
let's make a chocolate cake.

00:09:23.062 --> 00:09:24.397
-Okay!
-Yes, ma'am!

00:09:26.941 --> 00:09:28.859
Do I need my dagger for this?

00:09:28.943 --> 00:09:30.319
<i>Who's this punk?</i>

00:09:30.403 --> 00:09:31.571
A normal knife is fine.

00:09:31.654 --> 00:09:34.156
First, we will make the sponge.

00:09:34.240 --> 00:09:35.825
Please chop up the chocolate.

00:09:35.908 --> 00:09:36.742
RATATATATA

00:09:36.826 --> 00:09:37.660
CRUSH

00:09:37.743 --> 00:09:41.622
We'll melt the chocolate
at around 50 to 55 degrees.

00:09:41.706 --> 00:09:42.999
Ouch! So hot!

00:09:46.794 --> 00:09:48.713
Take it easy, you amateur!

00:09:48.796 --> 00:09:51.424
You need to be delicate
when making sweets. Give it here--

00:09:51.507 --> 00:09:52.383
SMACK

00:09:52.466 --> 00:09:54.635
This is my chocolate cake.

00:09:54.719 --> 00:09:55.845
Get your paws off of it.

00:09:58.598 --> 00:09:59.432
BAM

00:09:59.515 --> 00:10:00.641
Why?

00:10:00.725 --> 00:10:01.976
Why does it never go well?

00:10:03.519 --> 00:10:04.687
Hey, you.

00:10:04.770 --> 00:10:05.896
Don't touch me!

00:10:06.522 --> 00:10:08.608
You're disturbing
these honest-working folk.

00:10:10.067 --> 00:10:11.944
Do you have a problem with me?

00:10:12.862 --> 00:10:15.406
Why do you want to make a chocolate cake?

00:10:16.073 --> 00:10:18.868
I want to give it to someone close
to convey my feelings.

00:10:18.951 --> 00:10:21.579
I heard that
you give chocolates on this day.

00:10:21.662 --> 00:10:22.830
Got a problem with that?

00:10:22.913 --> 00:10:24.081
Listen…

00:10:24.582 --> 00:10:26.292
Cooking is all about…

00:10:27.001 --> 00:10:29.253
This. Your heart.

00:10:29.337 --> 00:10:31.839
You gotta unload it all into that cake.

00:10:31.922 --> 00:10:33.716
They won't know what hit 'em!

00:10:34.508 --> 00:10:37.053
Uh, a direct shot
from my heart to their heart…

00:10:37.553 --> 00:10:40.973
If you understand,
calm your ass down and get baking.

00:10:41.057 --> 00:10:44.352
You don't hafta tell me!
I'll bake my heart into that cake!

00:10:44.435 --> 00:10:45.561
DROP

00:10:45.645 --> 00:10:46.479
SHUT

00:10:46.562 --> 00:10:47.938
<i>Man, I'd completely forgotten.</i>

00:10:48.022 --> 00:10:49.273
<i>It's all about the heart.</i>

00:10:50.358 --> 00:10:51.859
<i>Be delicate.</i>

00:10:52.443 --> 00:10:53.819
<i>In a calm way.</i>

00:10:56.072 --> 00:10:57.239
<i>From the heart…</i>

00:10:57.740 --> 00:10:58.574
HAPPY VALENTINE'S DAY

00:10:58.658 --> 00:10:59.492
How's that?

00:10:59.575 --> 00:11:01.661
It's a bit messy, but…

00:11:01.744 --> 00:11:02.578
MORAL CODE

00:11:02.662 --> 00:11:04.288
Gotta thank you…

00:11:05.915 --> 00:11:06.749
What the hell?

00:11:07.667 --> 00:11:09.335
<i>Who is this guy?</i>

00:11:10.044 --> 00:11:11.587
<i>I swear I've seen him before…</i>

00:11:11.671 --> 00:11:14.215
Get 'em straight in the heart, man.

00:11:14.298 --> 00:11:15.675
Yeah…

00:11:16.425 --> 00:11:18.302
KUNIMI BUSINESS OFFICE

00:11:18.386 --> 00:11:19.303
HAPPY VALENTINE'S DAY

00:11:19.387 --> 00:11:21.764
Please… accept this.

00:11:23.265 --> 00:11:24.100
Boss!

00:11:25.101 --> 00:11:26.060
Hirono.

00:11:26.936 --> 00:11:28.521
Happy Valentine's Day!

00:11:31.065 --> 00:11:33.609
<i>My first Valentine's chocolate this year…</i>

00:11:33.692 --> 00:11:34.735
<i>Damn…</i>

00:11:34.819 --> 00:11:39.740
WOW, WHAT'S THIS?

00:11:39.824 --> 00:11:42.201
<i>We're just not able to save any money…</i>

00:11:42.284 --> 00:11:45.079
Anything my husband and I have,
we end up spending.

00:11:45.162 --> 00:11:47.164
We don't know how to manage our finances.

00:11:47.248 --> 00:11:50.584
Yuriko, you became a housewife
after getting married last year, right?

00:11:50.668 --> 00:11:52.753
I heard you were having difficulties,

00:11:53.421 --> 00:11:54.964
so I brought someone who can help.

00:11:56.048 --> 00:11:57.925
You havin' money troubles, yeah?

00:11:58.509 --> 00:12:01.178
I look after the household myself,

00:12:01.262 --> 00:12:03.389
so I'll let you in
on some worthwhile hustle.

00:12:03.973 --> 00:12:06.142
<i>Is this guy Miku's husband?</i>

00:12:06.225 --> 00:12:07.518
<i>Could he be a ya…</i>

00:12:08.018 --> 00:12:09.645
<i>No… Probably not.</i>

00:12:10.187 --> 00:12:11.856
Do you have good stamina?

00:12:12.440 --> 00:12:14.108
Huh? I'm not sure.

00:12:14.692 --> 00:12:17.987
If you're fit, we can use that body
to make some money.

00:12:18.070 --> 00:12:18.904
What?

00:12:18.988 --> 00:12:20.448
My… body?

00:12:20.531 --> 00:12:23.033
Matsuyo Supermarket
has sprouts and cabbages

00:12:23.117 --> 00:12:25.911
and Heiwa Mart has
the cheapest udon and eggs!

00:12:25.995 --> 00:12:28.622
-Draw a map and plan your shopping!
-Yes, sir!

00:12:28.706 --> 00:12:30.040
Use those legs to save money!

00:12:30.624 --> 00:12:31.625
God, that's quick.

00:12:32.710 --> 00:12:33.669
Welcome back.

00:12:33.752 --> 00:12:34.587
You okay?

00:12:35.296 --> 00:12:37.131
You got a sweet deal there.

00:12:37.214 --> 00:12:38.048
Yes.

00:12:38.132 --> 00:12:40.259
The rest, we can do inside the house.

00:12:40.843 --> 00:12:42.970
I'll show you some hustle
involving water now.

00:12:43.554 --> 00:12:44.930
Um, water?

00:12:45.014 --> 00:12:45.848
SCRUB

00:12:45.931 --> 00:12:47.349
Save water when washing dishes!

00:12:47.433 --> 00:12:49.185
Scrub and rinse all of them together!

00:12:49.268 --> 00:12:50.102
SHOWER

00:12:50.186 --> 00:12:51.812
Install a water-saving shower head!

00:12:51.896 --> 00:12:52.897
I'm getting wet.

00:12:52.980 --> 00:12:53.814
SQUEAK

00:12:53.898 --> 00:12:55.608
Tighten the toilet water valve a bit.

00:12:55.691 --> 00:12:59.320
The essence of saving is
being aware of all these little things.

00:13:00.112 --> 00:13:03.908
If you want to aim a bit higher though,
we have to get cutting.

00:13:03.991 --> 00:13:06.118
Do you mean, cutting my fing…

00:13:06.202 --> 00:13:07.369
I don't think I can…

00:13:07.453 --> 00:13:09.121
Come here!

00:13:09.205 --> 00:13:11.332
Tacchan… Wait a minute!

00:13:11.916 --> 00:13:13.459
Get a notebook for your accounts

00:13:13.542 --> 00:13:16.253
and cut the fat from
your living expenses and fixed costs.

00:13:16.337 --> 00:13:17.796
I'm so not good at this.

00:13:17.880 --> 00:13:21.258
Jeez, I don't know
if I can keep all of this going.

00:13:21.342 --> 00:13:23.385
You need to set a goal.

00:13:23.469 --> 00:13:26.972
For example, take a day off
from drinking canned coffee.

00:13:27.056 --> 00:13:29.934
Or go to the sea once a year.

00:13:30.518 --> 00:13:31.936
The sea?

00:13:32.603 --> 00:13:36.232
Trying to save all the time
can build up stress, right?

00:13:36.315 --> 00:13:39.318
So there is one method
that will get you high.

00:13:40.569 --> 00:13:42.988
Give yourself little rewards as motivation

00:13:43.072 --> 00:13:45.741
to keep up your efforts.

00:13:45.824 --> 00:13:48.786
Yeah, that might just work!

00:13:49.620 --> 00:13:51.956
See, it's not all bad, is it?

00:13:52.039 --> 00:13:55.167
<i>Saving, huh? Sounds hard.</i>

00:13:55.918 --> 00:13:56.919
<i>Ten </i>gacha<i> pulls.</i>

00:13:57.002 --> 00:13:58.629
<i>No… Better not.</i>

00:13:59.213 --> 00:14:03.092
What's this?
I'm looking at my husband's card usage.

00:14:03.175 --> 00:14:05.261
There was a really big withdrawal.

00:14:05.344 --> 00:14:07.054
I don't recall using that much.

00:14:07.137 --> 00:14:08.264
I wonder what it is.

00:14:08.764 --> 00:14:11.684
Well that's something for you
to talk about privately.

00:14:13.102 --> 00:14:15.813
Both of you must be serious
in this hustle, or it'll fail.

00:14:15.896 --> 00:14:18.232
You'll have to find out what it was.

00:14:18.315 --> 00:14:19.441
I'm back.

00:14:20.025 --> 00:14:22.403
Yuriko, do we have guests?

00:14:22.486 --> 00:14:24.154
Nice to meet you.

00:14:24.947 --> 00:14:28.450
I've been telling your missus
about how to hustle some savings.

00:14:28.534 --> 00:14:29.660
Hustle?

00:14:30.911 --> 00:14:33.372
Oh, you're Miku's husband.

00:14:33.455 --> 00:14:34.373
I see.

00:14:34.874 --> 00:14:37.501
That money is… Actually…

00:14:37.585 --> 00:14:38.752
Well…

00:14:38.836 --> 00:14:39.920
Uh…

00:14:40.921 --> 00:14:42.965
It's almost our wedding anniversary,

00:14:43.048 --> 00:14:45.301
so I thought I'd get my wife
something nice.

00:14:45.384 --> 00:14:46.218
What?

00:14:46.302 --> 00:14:47.511
Yuzuru!

00:14:47.595 --> 00:14:49.763
Sorry I suspected you.

00:14:49.847 --> 00:14:51.390
I'm so happy, Yuzuru.

00:14:51.473 --> 00:14:53.642
It's okay.
It's my fault for keeping quiet.

00:14:53.726 --> 00:14:55.728
Oh, what a cute bracelet!

00:14:55.811 --> 00:14:57.563
Hey, don't open it yet.

00:14:58.397 --> 00:15:00.065
I made dinner reservations too.

00:15:00.149 --> 00:15:01.567
No way, that's amazing.

00:15:01.650 --> 00:15:02.693
<i>-We'll be off.
-We'll be off.</i>

00:15:02.776 --> 00:15:06.113
SPECIAL PICK UP GACHA
COBALT POLICE COOKING STYLE

00:15:06.196 --> 00:15:07.698
SINGLE PULL, 10 PULLS

00:15:07.781 --> 00:15:09.450
Oh, no, I'm gonna be late.

00:15:09.533 --> 00:15:11.327
<i>I'm Miku and I'm 26 years old!</i>

00:15:11.410 --> 00:15:13.162
<i>I'm an office worker
who loves manga and games!</i>

00:15:13.746 --> 00:15:15.289
<i>I'm gonna do my best at work today!</i>

00:15:15.372 --> 00:15:16.624
SPARKLE

00:15:16.707 --> 00:15:17.625
POW

00:15:18.417 --> 00:15:19.668
Help me, woof!

00:15:19.752 --> 00:15:21.545
The earth is in peril, woof!

00:15:21.629 --> 00:15:23.505
Something came down from the sky?

00:15:23.589 --> 00:15:25.341
Ma-fia came down and attacked,

00:15:25.424 --> 00:15:27.718
and the head of the Nin-kyo
was killed, woof.

00:15:27.801 --> 00:15:31.055
At this rate,
the world will be in Ma-fia's clutches.

00:15:31.138 --> 00:15:32.556
-Please help--
-I understand.

00:15:32.640 --> 00:15:33.682
I'll do it!

00:15:33.766 --> 00:15:34.767
That didn't take long!

00:15:34.850 --> 00:15:35.684
SWISH

00:15:37.227 --> 00:15:38.604
There you are.

00:15:38.687 --> 00:15:39.772
Now give it up!

00:15:40.940 --> 00:15:42.816
-It's the Ma-fia head, woof!
-What?

00:15:42.900 --> 00:15:44.860
This is bad.
Let's fall back for now, woof!

00:15:44.944 --> 00:15:45.778
GRAB

00:15:46.403 --> 00:15:48.364
There's no use escaping.

00:15:48.447 --> 00:15:50.991
-Give me the transformation item quickly!
-Oh, already?

00:15:51.075 --> 00:15:52.785
Okay, here it is then…

00:15:52.868 --> 00:15:53.702
Good.

00:15:54.328 --> 00:15:57.915
Star Miracle Pretty Change!

00:16:00.709 --> 00:16:01.710
Wow.

00:16:01.794 --> 00:16:03.337
I can feel the power bursting out!

00:16:05.130 --> 00:16:06.298
I'd give it 64 points.

00:16:06.382 --> 00:16:07.216
What?

00:16:07.299 --> 00:16:08.842
It needs several improvements.

00:16:09.426 --> 00:16:11.595
First, what's the concept behind this?

00:16:11.679 --> 00:16:13.681
Uh, a magical girl, I think.

00:16:13.764 --> 00:16:16.058
Hmm, that's a little vague…

00:16:16.642 --> 00:16:18.686
You have these
symbolic elements put together,

00:16:18.769 --> 00:16:20.437
but I don't see the overall concept.

00:16:20.521 --> 00:16:21.355
Um… Right

00:16:21.438 --> 00:16:23.273
How exactly do you want to market this?

00:16:23.357 --> 00:16:26.527
I do like the material
for these frills, though.

00:16:27.194 --> 00:16:29.446
What are you two chattering about?

00:16:29.530 --> 00:16:31.115
SLAP

00:16:31.740 --> 00:16:33.158
Don't you know the protocol?

00:16:33.242 --> 00:16:34.994
How long have you been doing this job?

00:16:35.077 --> 00:16:41.125
First, I do the whole power up thing,
then you come in with your deadly moves.

00:16:41.208 --> 00:16:43.002
Then I'll react accordingly.

00:16:43.085 --> 00:16:45.754
So tell me,
what is this show's target audience?

00:16:45.838 --> 00:16:46.672
I…

00:16:46.755 --> 00:16:49.466
If it's for children,
then you shouldn't have yakuza appear.

00:16:49.550 --> 00:16:50.926
The parents would be shocked.

00:16:51.719 --> 00:16:53.595
Don't worry. I know you can do it!

00:16:53.679 --> 00:16:55.681
We can make this project work!

00:16:57.516 --> 00:16:59.935
So let's look at the areas
we can improve on

00:17:00.019 --> 00:17:02.521
and reconvene
for another meeting next week…
